{
  "_comment": [
    "Place-name gazetteer for Gujarat, used to position cameras whose upstream",
    "catalogue reports a location *name* but no coordinates.",
    "",
    "Keyed by place name, deliberately — never by camera id. The catalogue is",
    "explicit that camera ids and the set of available cameras can change, so a",
    "table keyed by id silently mis-places the whole estate the first time the",
    "organisers renumber it. A name survives renumbering.",
    "",
    "Tiers are tried in order: landmark, then city, then district centroid.",
    "Anything unresolved is flagged `unplaced` rather than guessed, so an",
    "operator can see which pins still need a survey position.",
    "",
    "Positions are approximate to the locality and good enough for geospatial",
    "search and corridor analysis. A real deployment takes them from the",
    "department asset register, which is what the registry's import API is for."
  ],
